" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-10 w-26" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogo.7f1bd2ac.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogo.7f1bd2ac.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogo.7f1bd2ac.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/></a><nav class="space-x-4"><a class="text-white hover:text-blue-300" href="/#features">Features</a><a class="text-white hover:text-blue-300" href="/#contact">Contact</a><a class="text-yellow-300 font-semibold  hover:text-blue-300" href="/prod">Try Now</a></nav></div></header><main class="flex-1 w-screen" data-theme="light"><div class="hero min-h-fit hero-overlay bg-opacity-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-600 to-gray-800"><div class="hero-content text-center text-neutral-content"><div class="max-w-md  text-gray-800"><h1 class="md:mt-8 md:mb-5 md:text-4xl text-2xl mb-2 font-medium text-slate-100">Your Interview Assistant</h1><p class="md:mb-10 md:text-3xl text-xl mb-3 text-yellow-400">Make Interviewing Easy<!-- --> </p><div class="rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-600 to-gray-800 md:pt-5 md:pb-5 md:pl-10 p-2 text-pretty sm:text-start text-center text-slate-300 md:mb-5 mb-2"><p class="md:mb-1 md:text-2xl text-lg font-light">Cue Cards, Questions, Evaluate, Report Card</p></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-gray-500 min-h-screen"><div class="bg-gray-100 py-6 sm:max-md:px-20 md:px-40"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="flex text-center flex-col items-center"><img alt="CueTip" loading="lazy" width="500" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fhero.gif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fhero.gif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fhero.gif&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75"/><p class="mt-5 text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-900 font-medium">Interviewing candidates takes time and effort. Quickly reading resumes and coming up with appropriate questions could be quite challenging if there is not enough prep time.</p><p class="mt-4 mb-4 text-lg sm:text-xl max-sm:mb-1 text-gray-900 font-semibold">CueTip is here to help.</p><a href="/prod"><button class="btn btn-warning mt-3 max-sm:mt-1 text-warning-content">Try Now For Free</button></a><p class="mt-6 mb-4 text-lg sm:text-xl max-sm:mb-1 text-gray-900 font-semibold">CueTip is in beta right now. Please subscribe to get discounted access on launch.<!-- --> <span class="font-light italic">Or, Buy me a coffee now for lifetime access.<!-- --> </span></p><div class="flex flex-row"><button class="btn btn-warning m-2 text-warning-content max-sm:mt-1">Subscribe</button><div><dialog id="subscribe_modal" class="modal sm:modal-middle"><div class="modal-box bg-gray-600"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-200">Hello!</h3><p class="py-4 text-gray-200">Please subscribe to get discounted access on launch.</p><div class="modal-action justify-center flex flex-col items-center mt-1"><form class="flex items-center gap-2 max-sm:flex-col sm:flex-row" action="" encType="multipart/form-data" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="$ACTION_REF_2"/><input type="hidden" name="$ACTION_2:0" value="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;3b36d7508295cfc1a65e48b4682a61b9346245c0&quot;,&quot;bound&quot;:&quot;$@1&quot;}"/><input type="hidden" name="$ACTION_2:1" value="[{&quot;message&quot;:&quot;&quot;}]"/><input type="hidden" name="$ACTION_KEY" value="k1839078549"/><label class="input input-bordered flex items-center gap-2 "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 opacity-70"><path d="M2.5 3A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1 4.5v.793c.026.009.051.02.076.032L7.674 8.51c.206.1.446.1.652 0l6.598-3.185A.755.755 0 0 1 15 5.293V4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 13.5 3h-11Z"></path><path d="M15 6.954 8.978 9.86a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.956 0L1 6.954V11.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2.5 13h11a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5-1.5V6.954Z"></path></svg><input type="email" class="grow" placeholder="Email" autoComplete="email" required="" name="email"/></label><button type="submit" class="btn btn-warning">Subscribe</button></form><form method="dialog"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-circle btn-ghost absolute right-2 top-2 text-gray-200">✕</button></form></div></div></dialog></div><a class="btn btn-warning mt-2 text-warning-content max-sm:mt-1" href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/cuetip"><img alt="Buy me a coffee" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.buymeacoffee.com/buttons/bmc-new-btn-logo.svg"/><span>Buy me a coffee</span></a></div></div></div></div><div id="features" class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="card max-w-fit px-4 py-2 sm:m-5 max-sm:m-4 sm:text-3xl text-xl mb-2 font-medium text-slate-100 bg-opacity-6 bg-gray-600 text-center"><p class="">CueTip Features</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="hero min-h-fit bg-gray-100"><div class="hero-content flex-col md:flex-row"><img alt="Feature Image" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-w-sm rounded-lg shadow-2xl" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fcuecards.gif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fcuecards.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fcuecards.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/><div><h1 class="text-xl font-bold">Cue Cards</h1><p class="py-6 text-lg text-gray-900 font-normal">Upload the resume and get the information summary in Cue Cards for the interview. Each card represents a category of information.<!-- --> </p><a href="/prod"><button class="btn btn-outline bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-300 to-orange-500">Get Started</button></a></div></div></div><div class="hero min-h-fit bg-gray-200"><div class="hero-content flex-col md:flex-row-reverse"><img alt="Feature Image" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-w-sm rounded-lg shadow-2xl" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fquestions.gif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fquestions.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fquestions.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/><div><h1 class="text-xl font-bold">Questions for Interview</h1><p class="py-6 text-lg text-gray-900 font-normal">Upload the resume and get AI generated questions based on the information in the resume. Get questions for each category represented in Cue Cards. Discard any questions you don&#x27;t like. Request more questions.<!-- --> </p><a href="/prod"><button class="btn btn-outline bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-300 to-orange-500">Get Started</button></a></div></div></div><div class="hero min-h-fit bg-gray-100"><div class="hero-content flex-col md:flex-row"><img alt="Feature Image" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-w-sm rounded-lg shadow-2xl" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fevaluation.gif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fevaluation.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fevaluation.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/><div><h1 class="text-xl font-bold">Score Answers and Add Notes</h1><p class="py-6 text-lg text-gray-900 font-normal">Score the candidates answers to the questions and add notes for each answer. Mark the question done when satisfied with the answer.<!-- --> </p><a href="/prod"><button class="btn btn-outline bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-300 to-orange-500">Get Started</button></a></div></div></div><div class="hero min-h-fit bg-gray-200"><div class="hero-content flex-col md:flex-row-reverse"><img alt="Feature Image" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-w-sm rounded-lg shadow-2xl" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Freport.gif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Freport.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Freport.gif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/><div><h1 class="text-xl font-bold">Download Report Card</h1><p class="py-6 text-lg text-gray-900 font-normal">Download the Report Card with the scores and notes for each question.<!-- --> </p><a href="/prod"><button class="btn btn-outline bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-300 to-orange-500">Get Started</button></a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="contact" class="flex flex-col items-center"><div class="card max-w-fit px-4 py-2 sm:m-5 max-sm:m-4 sm:text-3xl text-xl mb-2 font-medium text-slate-100 bg-opacity-6 bg-gray-600 text-center"><p class="">Contact Us</p></div><div class="card w-full sm:px-48 max-sm:px-7"><form action="" encType="multipart/form-data" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="$ACTION_REF_3"/><input type="hidden" name="$ACTION_3:0" value="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;a3903d04f9857176c28046e3f63382d37e35f28f&quot;,&quot;bound&quot;:&quot;$@1&quot;}"/><input type="hidden" name="$ACTION_3:1" value="[null]"/><input type="hidden" name="$ACTION_KEY" value="k1888756276"/><div class="w-full flex flex-col"><div class="mb-4 sm:min-w-xl sm:max-w-3xl justify-self-auto"><input type="text" id="name" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md sm:text-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500" placeholder="Your Name" required="" name="name" value=""/></div><div class="mb-4 sm:min-w-xl sm:max-w-3xl"><input type="email" id="email" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md sm:text-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500" placeholder="Your Email Address" required="" name="email" value=""/></div><div class="mb-4 sm:min-w-xl sm:max-w-3xl"><textarea id="message" name="message" class="w-full px-3 py-2 textarea-info textarea-lg max-sm:text-lg border border-gray-300 rounded-md sm:min-h-52 max-sm:min-h-40 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500" required="" placeholder="What can we do for you?"></textarea></div></div><div class="flex flex-row mb-4 justify-center"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-warning">Submit</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-info ml-2">Clear</button></div></form></div></div></div></main><footer class="footer footer-cen